[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "むっ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ggh...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まだ、やるつもり？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you still planning to fight?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "君たちが相当な頑固者であることは理解できた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can see that you're all quite stubborn."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここまで言って聞かないのなら、一度手を引こう。\n自分たちで他の道を探してみるがいい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you won't heed my advice, then try to find another way out on your own."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、待って……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, wait...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "行っちゃった。\nそういうところはシトリンにそっくり……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "He left. That's so like Citrine..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんな！\u3000大丈夫？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone! Are you okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナちゃん！\u3000みんな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana! Everyone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんながまた中に入ってから、\nしばらく出てこないんだもの。何があったのよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You all went back in and didn't return for ages. What happened?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと厄介なことがあってね。\nああでも、いったん片は付いたんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We ran into some trouble. But we managed to resolve it for now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "厄介なことって……詳しく聞かせてもらえますか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Trouble? Could you tell us more about what happened?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うわぁ。九偉人まで出てきちゃったのか。\nそりゃ厄介だったね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa. One of the nine showed up? That must have been troublesome."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。どうにか全員で外に出る方法を\n探りたいと思っているんだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. I want to try to find a way for all of us to get out together..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひとまず、奴が連れて来た山賊たちについては、\n私に任せてくれ。然るべき場所に引き渡してこよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For now, leave those bandits he brought to me. I'll hand them over to the proper authorities."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姫。しばらくそばを離れることを\n許していただきたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Princess, please allow me to leave your side for a while."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "も、もう役は終わりですから～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "B-but the roleplay is over!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ロロナ先生だって楽しそうだったのに……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You looked like you were having fun, Miss Rorona..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それでは私はここで",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I shall take my leave."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "にしてもどうしたもんかな～。\n邪魔な文章消したりとかしたらダメ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So what should we do? Would it be so bad if we just erased problematic bits?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "下手に触って一生出られなくなったらどうするのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do you really want to risk us not being able to get out forever?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん、それもそっかあ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, point taken..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姫と騎士は村に取り残され、二人ぼっちになりました\nとさ……ってとこ、なーんか引っかかるんだよね～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That part about the princess and knight being left behind, alone together... something about it really bugs me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "た、確かに。「二人で暮らした」でもなくて、\n「二人ぼっち」ってところが！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yeah! It doesn't say that they lived together but specifically that they were alone together!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこ気になるの、ロロナさんだけかと思ってたけど、\nもしかしたら何かあるのかもしれないわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I thought only Rorona was bothered by that detail, but perhaps there really is something to it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "寂しさを表現しただけなのかなって\n思ってたんだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I thought it was just expressing solitude and isolation..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お姫様は家族も友達もいなかったんだよ。\n騎士が居てくれるのに、そんな言い方になるかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The princess had no family or friends. With the knight there for her, should it really have been phrased that way?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人きりだけど、でも寂しくない……\nそんな風になるんじゃないかなって思うんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Without the part about being alone?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でもこれは単に、出られない人数のことを\n言ってるはず……よね、姉様？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That refers to the number of people who can't leave... right, Alvina?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人ぼっち。二人きり……\nふふふ。アルビちゃん、閃いちゃったねこれは",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alone together. Just the two of them... Hehe. I've got an idea!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆、注目。姉様が何か閃いた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone, listen up. Alvina's had a breakthrough."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "要は、二人残ってくれればいいんでしょ。\nお姫様と騎士である必要はないわけ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The point is, two people need to stay behind, right? They don't have to be the actual princess and knight."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だったら、本物の人間じゃなくて、\nそれっぽいカカシでも置いておけばいいんじゃない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So instead of real people, what if we just left some realistic scarecrows or something?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それよ！\u3000考えたじゃない！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I like where this is going!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でしょでしょ！\u3000いい案でしょ？\u3000まぁよっぽど\nよくできたやつじゃないと無理だろうけどね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's a great plan, isn't it? Though they'd have to be really well-made to work."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そうだね、やってみよう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yeah, it's worth a shot!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃあ……行ってくるからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All right then... I'll be back soon."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "心配しなくても大丈夫だって！\nある意味、この本の中は安全な場所なんだから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't worry, we'll be fine! There are no dangers lurking in the book anymore!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちはあんたを信じてるから。\n早く戻ってきなさいよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We believe in you. Just hurry back."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとう二人とも……！\nなんか気持ちが軽くなったよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks, you two...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ、行きましょ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna, let's go."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000それじゃ、行ってきます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right! We'll be back soon!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]